.TH GHSTARS-TUI 1 "2026-08-26" "ghstars 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ghstars-tui \- manage GitHub Stars in an interactive terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ghstars tui
.SH DESCRIPTION
The TUI reads the last local snapshot when it starts.
It does not sync automatically.
Press
.B y
to start an explicit sync.
.PP
The Star table keeps every configured column.
Scroll horizontally when the columns do not fit.
The active Layout controls the column order, row height, and Detail pane.
.SH MAIN KEYS
.TP
.B t
Tag or retag the current Star or selected Stars.
.TP
.B Space
Select or clear the current Star.
.TP
.B a
Select all Stars.
.TP
.B c
Clear the selection.
.TP
.B d
Show or hide the Detail pane.
.TP
.B l
Show GitHub Lists.
.TP
.B f
Open the Filter menu.
.TP
.B /
Search Star names and descriptions.
.TP
.B x
Clear Search and the active Filter on the main screen.
.TP
.B s
Select the next sort order.
.TP
.B z
Select the next Layout.
.TP
.B o
Open the current Star in the default browser.
.TP
.B u
Open the unstar confirmation screen.
.TP
.B r
Refresh the GitHub API rate limit.
.TP
.B y
Run a full explicit sync.
.TP
.B g
Open the config editor.
.TP
.B q
Save TUI session state and quit from the main screen.
.TP
.B Ctrl+P
Open the command palette.
Select
.B Edit config
or
.B Show config path
for config operations.
.SH CONFIG EDITOR
The config editor reads
.I tui.toml
from disk when it opens.
The fixed header stays visible while the form body scrolls.
The first field receives focus.
Press Tab or Shift+Tab to move through fields.
.PP
Boolean settings use explicit Yes and No selectors.
Initial Layout uses Compact and Balanced selectors.
Keybindings are the last form section.
.TP
.B Escape
Validate the form.
Save changed valid values and close the editor.
Keep an invalid form open and show an error notification.
A saved change takes effect after restart.
.TP
.B x
Discard all form edits and close the editor.
.TP
.B q
Do not quit while the config editor is open.
.SH FILTER MENU
Press
.B f
to open the menu.
Use the displayed keys to select Category, Intent, List, Language, License, Recency, Owner, Fork, Follow, or Unclassified filters.
Search and Filter apply together.
.SH SAFETY
The TUI never syncs without the
.B y
key.
Unstar requires a confirmation screen.
Tag and unstar operations change GitHub immediately.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.ghstars/config/tui.toml
User-authored TUI settings.
.TP
.I ~/.ghstars/state/tui-state.toml
Machine-owned session state.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ghstars (1),
.BR ghstars-tui (5)
